  "pages": 6
 },
 "summary": "Transient voltage suppressor diodes in the DO-214AB (SMC J-bend) package that take 3000 W peak from a 10/1000 µs pulse (4000 W for stacked-die parts). Stand-off voltages run from 5.0 V to 220 V, each as an A part (uni-directional) and a CA part (bi-directional), with a 5 % breakdown tolerance. SMDJ36CA is the bi-directional part with 36 V stand-off, 40.00 V to 44.20 V breakdown at 1 mA, and 58.1 V maximum clamping at 51.6 A.",
 "key_figures": [
  [
   "Peak pulse power PPPM, 10/1000 µs",
   "3000 W single die; 4000 W stacked die"
  ],
